# Vendor provision client CAs (C5)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file is a placeholder. Do **not** commit real manufacturer CA PEMs here.
#
# On the SBC, install a concatenated PEM at:
#   /etc/nginx/pbx3-provision/vendor-client-cas.pem
#
# Near-term lab prove: Snom + Yealink CAs (ops-held inventory).
# Other brands may use the same path when CAs are available.
#
# Install:
#   sudo VENDOR_CLIENT_CA_BUNDLE=/path/to/vendor-client-cas.pem \
#        PROVISION_MTLS=optional \
#        ./scripts/install-provision-edge.sh
#
# PROVISION_MTLS=off|optional|require
#   off      — no client-cert verify (default when no CA file)
#   optional — verify when phone presents a cert; allow no-cert (lab + manual-URL brands)
#   require  — reject TLS handshake without a trusted client cert (hardened public edge)
